    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c7Summary</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a spinning cleaner to clean up trash! Move and connect with various cleaning tools one after another. Aim for high scores within 90 seconds in each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c7Cleaning Tools</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with regular brooms and dustpans </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid-fire sprayers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying vacuum cleaners </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant chainsaws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cleaning tools with unique functions appear in each level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels and gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The satisfaction of cleaning up trash all at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve high scores to unlock new cleaners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
